      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree that the viewpoint changing twice during load is an annoyance.\nVRChat can't know the height of an avatar until it has loaded in.\nThe best way to handle this would be to keep the viewpoint height of the previous avatar when switching, and only change the viewpoint height when the new avatar loads.\nWhen starting the game, the viewpoint of the avatar the player was in when they closed the game last time would be stored locally.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-21T16:23:17.925Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am always surprised when changing avatars, when the avatar switches to the loading avatar before loading the avatar, suddenly everything changes from the viewpoint position to the height.\nI think it is time to fix this spec.\nAt the very least, it would be nice if the pre-set ViewPoint could be referenced first and the size of the avatar for loading could be adjusted.\nアバター変更時に、アバターを読み込む前のローディング用アバターに切り替わると、突然視点の位置から高さまですべて変わってしまい、いつもびっくりしています。\nそろそろこの仕様を修正してもいいと思います。\nせめて、事前に設定したViewPointを真っ先に参照し、ローディング用アバターの大きさを合わせておいてもいいと思います。",
